#  A pile of gluScript text of unknown origin. Not ours to redistribute, and
#  nothing in the project reads it -- the interpreter works off the compiled
#  bytecode in big/, per PLAN.md M3.4.
flow scripts/
saves/
userdata/
10-17-2011/
big_360_out/
assets/

# ============================================================
#  Third-party binaries we DO commit
# ============================================================
#  SDL3 ships as an official prebuilt VC package rather than source (see
#  PLAN.md section 2), so its .lib and .dll have to be in the repo or a fresh
#  clone will not link. Three rules above would otherwise swallow them:
#  "x64/" and "*.lib" -- and a file cannot be re-included while its parent
#  directory is excluded, so the directory has to be un-ignored first.
!src/third_party/SDL3/lib/x64/
!src/third_party/SDL3/lib/x64/*.lib

